# Darksteel Angel: "You can't lose the game and your opponents can't win the game." Bot1 begins at 3 life and puts the Angel
# out on turn 3 off an Island, Black Lotus and five Moxen (nine mana). Bot2 Bolts Bot1 to 0 on turn 4: the state-based action
# that would make Bot1 lose does not run, the game goes on at 0 life, and Bot2, who would win, does not. The Angel shows its
# flying and indestructible.

